prompt_messages.content:
GOAL:
{'id': 'data-01-dbt-pipeline', 'description': 'dbt pipeline: extract from S3 to stage, transform, load, verify', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'production', 'tools': ['dbt', 'airflow', 'spark']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'balanced', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

prompt_full_text:
--- system ---
/no_think You are a planner. Reply with ONLY a JSON object (no markdown, no prose, no thinking). Use EXACTLY these field names: id, goal_id, version, tasks, dependencies, branches. Each task uses: id, description, action, target, risk_class, optional rollback{trigger,action,safety_guard}, optional verification{what,how,expected}, optional preconditions (array of {description, fact, established_by}), optional parallel_group, optional blast_radius. preconditions MUST be objects with description, fact, established_by fields — NEVER strings. established_by MUST be the id of an earlier task in the plan that establishes the fact, or 'env' if it is an environment fact (not a task output). Do NOT use fact names or descriptions as established_by — use the task id. Each dependency uses: from_task, to_task, kind, optional reason. Each branch uses: id, kind, tasks, join. High/critical risk tasks MUST have rollback AND verification. All tasks with risk_class high or critical MUST include both rollback and verification objects. Example shape: {"id":"plan-x","goal_id":"g","version":1,"tasks":[{"id":"backup","description":"Back up the database","action":"backup","target":"db","risk_class":"medium","preconditions":[{"description":"db is reachable","fact":"db_healthy","established_by":"env"}]},{"id":"migrate","description":"Apply schema migration","action":"migrate","target":"schema","risk_class":"high","rollback":{"trigger":"migration fails","action":"restore from backup","safety_guard":"verify backup integrity"},"verification":{"what":"schema version","how":"run checks","expected":"v2"}}],"dependencies":[{"from_task":"backup","to_task":"migrate","kind":"hard"}]}

--- user ---
GOAL:
{'id': 'data-01-dbt-pipeline', 'description': 'dbt pipeline: extract from S3 to stage, transform, load, verify', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'production', 'tools': ['dbt', 'airflow', 'spark']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'balanced', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

response_content:
{
  "id": "data-01-dbt-pipeline",
  "goal_id": "data-01-dbt-pipeline",
  "version": 1,
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "extract_data",
      "description": "Extract data from S3 to staging area",
      "action": "extract",
      "target": "staging_area",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "S3 bucket is accessible",
          "fact": "s3_accessible",
          "established_by": "env"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transform_data",
      "description": "Transform the extracted data",
      "action": "transform",
      "target": "transformed_data",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "transformation fails",
        "action": "revert to raw data",
        "safety_guard": "check data integrity"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "transformation output",
        "how": "run validation checks",
        "expected": "data in expected format"
      },
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "extracted data is available",
          "fact": "extracted_data_ready",
          "established_by": "extract_data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "load_data",
      "description": "Load transformed data into the target database",
      "action": "load",
      "target": "target_db",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "loading fails",
        "action": "restore previous data snapshot",
        "safety_guard": "verify snapshot integrity"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "data load status",
        "how": "check load logs",
        "expected": "all records loaded successfully"
      },
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "transformed data is ready",
          "fact": "transformed_data_ready",
          "established_by": "transform_data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "verify_data",
      "description": "Verify the loaded data integrity",
      "action": "verify",
      "target": "loaded_data",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "data has been loaded",
          "fact": "data_loaded",
          "established_by": "load_data"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "from_task": "extract_data",
      "to_task": "transform_data",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "transform_data",
      "to_task": "load_data",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "load_data",
      "to_task": "verify_data",
      "kind": "hard"
    }
  ],
  "branches": []
}
